            <p class="lead">Try the demos yourself, and get in touch:</p>
            <ul class="contact">
              <li><span>Web</span><b>nitishsingh.com</b></li>
              <li><span>This deck</span><b>nitishsingh.com/slides/data-platform</b></li>
              <li><span>UNS deck</span><b>nitishsingh.com/slides/uns</b></li>
              <li><span>LinkedIn</span><b>linkedin.com/in/nitish-singh</b></li>
